config ESPHOME_ESP32P4_CACHE_SAFE_RESTART
    bool "Stall ESP32-P4 peer CPU and drain cache sync before software restart"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
    default n
    help
        Opt in to the reviewed ESP-IDF 5.5.5 ESP32-P4 restart workaround for
        espressif/esp-idf#19171. Preserve an in-progress shared cache sync by
        stalling the other CPU without first resetting it. Wait until sync
        operation enable bits clear before issuing the restart writeback.
        This wait has no timeout and cannot recover a wedged hardware engine.
